{
  "schema": "adl.graph.v1",
  "project": "holdem",
  "description": "NLHE engine. Plugins: out ≤ K, no plugin→plugin. H5 + agent protocol are compose; GitHub auth is infra.",
  "K": 2,
  "hand_order": [
    "dealer.advance",
    "deck.deal",
    "betting.collect",
    "evaluate.showdown",
    "bank.settle",
    "seat.present"
  ],
  "nodes": [
    { "id": "contracts", "role": "contracts", "path": "src/contracts/" },
    { "id": "config", "role": "infra", "path": "src/config/" },
    { "id": "auth", "role": "infra", "path": "src/auth/" },
    { "id": "app", "role": "compose", "path": "src/app/" },
    { "id": "runtime", "role": "compose", "path": "src/runtime/" },
    { "id": "hosts", "role": "compose", "path": "src/hosts/" },
    { "id": "deck", "role": "plugin", "path": "src/deck/" },
    { "id": "evaluate", "role": "plugin", "path": "src/evaluate/" },
    { "id": "betting", "role": "plugin", "path": "src/betting/" },
    { "id": "dealer", "role": "plugin", "path": "src/dealer/" },
    { "id": "bank", "role": "plugin", "path": "src/bank/" },
    { "id": "seat", "role": "plugin", "path": "src/seat/" }
  ],
  "edges": [
    { "from": "deck", "to": "contracts", "kind": "implements" },
    { "from": "evaluate", "to": "contracts", "kind": "implements" },
    { "from": "betting", "to": "contracts", "kind": "implements" },
    { "from": "betting", "to": "config", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "dealer", "to": "contracts", "kind": "implements" },
    { "from": "dealer", "to": "config", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "bank", "to": "contracts", "kind": "implements" },
    { "from": "bank", "to": "config", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "seat", "to": "contracts", "kind": "implements" },
    { "from": "app", "to": "runtime", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "app", "to": "config", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "app", "to": "auth", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "app", "to": "contracts", "kind": "wires" },
    { "from": "app", "to": "hosts", "kind": "wires" },
    { "from": "runtime", "to": "contracts", "kind": "dispatches" },
    { "from": "runtime", "to": "config", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "hosts", "to": "contracts", "kind": "adapts" },
    { "from": "hosts", "to": "runtime", "kind": "uses" },
    { "from": "hosts", "to": "auth", "kind": "uses" }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "No plugin→plugin. Dealer never imports betting/deck; it talks DealPort / BettingQuery / StreetEvent on the bus.",
    "seat is one githubLogin. control=manual (player clicks) or hosted (their AI acts). Exclusive, not an AI opponent on another seat.",
    "Do not add a 'blinds' or 'side-pot' plugin — those live in betting + config.",
    "GitHub OAuth lives in auth infra. Plugins never import GitHub SDK. Agent uses table token, not iframe OAuth.",
    "Star-for-tokens: auth checks starred via user token; compose calls BankPort.grant once. Do not add bank→auth.",
    "Cursor auto-play MUST go through hosts/agent tools, never DOM clicks on the H5."
  ]
}
